<h1>Preseason Week 1: <em>The Rookie QBs Debuting and What Their Combine Numbers Say</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 8 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🏟️ Preseason 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">NFL preseason opened this week, and several first-year quarterbacks are making their first appearances in a live NFL game. Here's what the combine testing numbers say about the rookies fans will be watching closest — and why two of this class's top passers skipped the drills entirely.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
<div class="toc-label">In This Article</div>
